          "level": "h2",
          "text": "Our Story"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "widget": "text-editor",
      "paragraphs": [
        "Mid Valley Storage has deep roots in the beautiful Central Valley. Starting in 2004, it’s parent company began operating a property management company for residential real estate. Just a few years later as the company grew, they began their first ground-up construction project building a self storage and retail complex in East Visalia in 2009. Thousands of happy customers later, an expansion was made to Tulare with the extensive remodel of another self storage facility, Rapid Self Storage. In the following years, the property management component of the company grew to include additional residential and commercial rentals. Beginning in late 2018, a new site was chosen for another self-storage facility in Central Visalia and construction began. It’s newest site on Santa Fe features individual RV storage and drive-up self-storage. Today, Mid Valley Storage has all types of storage to fit your needs. Temperature controlled storage, drive-up self storage, indoor RV/boat storage, and a full moving center and free moving truck to make your storage experience as easy as possible."
      ]
    },
