          "year": "2009",
          "text": "Mid Valley Storage opens its first facility located in East Visalia. Drive-up units, temperature controlled, and outdoor parking."
        },
        {
          "year": "2012",
          "text": "Mid Valley Storage's parent company purchases and fully remodels a self-storage facility in Tulare, CA - Rapid Self Storage"
        },
        {
          "year": "2018",
          "text": "Mid Valley Storage acquires property in central Visalia and begins construction to build the area's premier self storage."
        },
        {
          "year": "2020",
          "text": "Mid Valley Storage opens it's new newest facility on Santa Fe Rd and K Rd. Featuring indoor RV storage and conventional units."
